            text = "yihsthv khalonethv utselikha nahskhiya anatholehohskhiyi khvniyukwho tsinvli tsinvhsithahsthi ikhvyithitlhhv thatsathvnvihsthaneli ikhvyithitlhhv nikhaweha alitsithohvhskhe khehsv khayvthathhinethiyi tsiluhsilimi ale nikhathv nahskhi ulinikhithiyu ehskhakwho thayai akwhathihsathathihsthiyi khalvkwhothiyu athanvtho nulihsthhanei nahselithi tsulohse khilakwhono iyvthv tsunhaluhsv ukhohe ulihsthuithv khehsei athanvtho khulethihskhonihi nahskhiyai tsutlhhoahsithihse nahskhi ale nvtsuwehse khalvlathi tsikhi khilakwhono iyvthv athanvtho nvkhahskhohi tsuhsvhithv hsethani ale inakhe enhai thinikhhanhawathithohi alitsithohvhskhe ohsthv khhanohethv unelanvhi khehsv ale nikhawehskhei nhakwho aliyilokha khehsv thitsinetlhhiyvna thetsathanvthvi itsohiyuhvkha ohsthv khhanohethv ulothi thukhohe enithi nahskhi anikhayaluvhskhei anikhayaluvhskhiyeno hia nithuwehselei thihsthikhayaluvhskhi nvthahsthvyvneli khilakwhono iyvthv tsunikhayaluthi khvwahsthawathvhsei uhsthikhithv tsekwhithi nahskwho unatsae tsunikhayaluthi khilakwhono iyvthv nahskhi unvthetsvno tsekwhithi tsuninvhsithahsthi itsulaha khvwahsthawathvhsei khilakwhono iyvthv thikhalawiihsthiyi ikha unihskwhanikhohseno thutheyoneyeno ulinikhithv tsuho thinowelihskhi thanatheyohvhskhv tsunilawiihsthiyino ayae ahskhaya thikhathathvthothi tsikho hskhithvthhanilv nahskhi unelanvhi athanvtho ulvthehsthhanv unihskwhanikhohsei khehsv uyelvthi hia khehsvi khvthi anikhathaha khilakwhono iyvthv khehsvi khilakwhono iyvthv enithi aninelv uthalii utsi khanvkhe utlhhvkhe khilakwhono iyvthv uthilehvhskhvno khilakwho iyvthv uhsvno nhakwho nvtho wuthelitsv thekhvwathhinohele nikhathv tsunitlhhvkhi thikhvwaniyai tsunitlhhvkhi vyukhi thunukhowihsei waninekhi yithelihsehe uthikhalihsthothihskhe khvwolikhvi khohithiyu khvwakhitsvthi khehsv uthithvhe nahskhi khvwahsthawathvhsei nikhathvkwho yvwi khetsayohse hiano nithuwehselei thothikhathuhv nahskwho khalitsithonitholvha nahskhiyeno akhilutsilv alitsithonithoheno utlhhvkhi ohsiyu yitsayelvnv yelikwho khatholikhv uthoyanvhithei ale hia tsathanvkhalvthv khehsehsthi unetsvkwhono khilakwho iyvthv uthanvkhalvthv khehsei ulinikhithvno khilakwho iyvthv unetsele khohuhsthi henakwhohskhini khvnikhehsv walihskholvtha alihskholvthothiyi unukhotsv thuyelihihsthhanei thunotsalane nahskhi nahskhino nhakwho khvnikhehsv yikhehse thoyithitlhhvkwhohskhini inakhe thekhehsathihsv ethohei nikhvnathvkwhono khvwalutsehei athalenihskhv khhanohethv tsihsa unelanvhi uwetsi hia tsinikhvnv tsikhowela tsakhhathv nahskhi tsalohihsthiyi uwelukha khilo inakhei hia etsathvnvihsthahsi yihowa ulohihsthiyi thunvnv thitsitsinohihstha tsani thathawohskhe inakhei ale khhanohehskhe thithawehsthi khanetlhhiyvhsthiyi othanvthv ukhvwali nahskhi ahskhanvtsvi ale wikhvwalutsele nikhvnathv tsuthiyi ale anehi thunawoe tsothani uweyvi unihskhanvtsv aninohvhskhei tsanino unuwe khemili uhsthiyenvhi khanotsino uthatlhhohsthei vleno ale wathulihsi inakhe ehi alihsthayvthihskhei alitsithohvhskheno hia nikhawehskhei utlhhi ayv oni nahskhi tsulahsulokhihi thakhhanehsathv vtlhha yeli yinikhoi ale thikhikhhaneyvthiyi ayv uthohiyuhi ama thetsvyawohsthhanv nahskhihskhini thothatsawohsthhani nahiyuno hia tsihsa nahskhi khelili tsikhathuha ale tsani uthawoe tsothani amayi tsuthanvhsv khalvloi ale uweyalvtsei hia nihi khvkheyui akwhetsi nahskhi ohsiyu khvyelvi inakhe wuthhinvhsthhanei nanhano inakhe ethohe ukholiyehskhei thekhelathithohei ale khvwahsthelvhithohei tsanino thithahsthuthiyi natsiyvthhanei tsihsa khelili ulutsei ukhvwiyuhi ukhvwali hia ale unelanvhi ukhvwiyuhi ehskhaniyu thayai ale khelilino vthali aihsvi hsawani ale thinathanvtlhhi vthali khehsei tsihsano hskhinihsthawathukha yvwino thuniyohse ale nanhano wiuwenv thukhohe tsimi uwetsi tsanino nahskhi thinathanvtlhhi nahskhino tsiyuhi thanotlhhvhihsihskhe withuyanvhei unithotha khekhakhuyvehi tsiyuhi unatsavi khekwhanino wuniyvlei wuyvlv thutheyone unathothakwhahskhv nuhsthv thatheyohvhskhvi nahskhiyai vtlhhano nahskhiya yikhehsei khathaha